Hi, I have here an ES40 with similar configuration (but only one CPU).
I've successfully installed Gentoo Linux with a recent kernel and it
runs pretty well, compiiling everything from scratch. The only thing to
be aware of is the CFLAGS setting for gcc:

-mieee -mcpu=ev67 -Wa,-mev6

